Package: dengue-suramerica
Title: South American Dengue Genome Curation Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dengue", "Suramerica", email = "noreply@example.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads, curates, and organizes dengue virus sequences from
    NCBI GenBank for South American countries. Produces FASTA and GenBank
    files organized by serotype and country, with metadata, statistics,
    and QC tiers suitable for phylogenetic analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.0.0), xml2 (>= 1.3.0), openxlsx (>= 4.2.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1